5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry we focus on impressive pitches rather than actual weekly floor errors.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,Agreed. We need to see who actually absorbs the extra workload before approving anything.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Confidence is cheap. I want to know if the technical groundwork was even checked.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Before we pick a project, we must confirm which budget line actually pays for it.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I am curious why we keep picking ideas that die after six months.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,Maybe we should look at the incident logs to see where time is really lost.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"Yes, and check the staffing of the coordination group to see who is drowning.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I will look into network coverage at customer plants. That is where promises break.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the capital budget and software allowance. The source matters more than the idea.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I want to see the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts. We need to learn from them.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"If we ignore the small daily losses, the big projects will fail anyway.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,"Exactly. If the rota breaks, the project fails. I will check the staffing.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will also check vendor licence pricing. Fixed fees are safer than open-ended access.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also look at the record of cross-unit standardization efforts. Consistency saves money later.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will also look at time lost to copying existing records. That is pure waste.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I will look into misrouted deliveries in the incident logs. That is a clear, measurable pain.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,"I will also look into in-house developer availability. If they are busy, the project stalls.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I am done. I have my two items.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am done. I have my two items.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I am done. I have my two items.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
